data: {"id": "212a47b4355d4ee2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1245", "run_id": "212a47b4355d4ee2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 身份与生命周期**\n- Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` (UID: `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`) 调度在 `node2`。\n- Phase 为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（`ready=False`, `restarts=0`）。\n- 控制器链路：`Deployment/workload` → `ReplicaSet/workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → `Pod/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh`。\n- 镜像：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` (IfNotPresent)。\n\n**关键事件 (Events)**\n- **根本原因已定位**：379 次重复的 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件，明确消息为：\n  > `Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-b", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789062764742, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

