data: {"id": "212a47b4355d4ee2-final", "run_id": "212a47b4355d4ee2", "seq": 1250, "ts_ms": 1789062781809, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法创建沙箱 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending | 确认 Pod 当前处于等待调度或创建阶段的状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.condition`: `ContainersReady=False` (Reason: `ContainersNotReady`), `Ready=False` | 直接证实 Pod 内部容器未就绪，未进入业务运行阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 明确故障卡点位于容器沙箱创建（Sandbox Creation）阶段，而非镜像拉取或启动后 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.spec`: 未直接展示，但诊断指出引用了 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'` | 指向网络插件在沙箱初始化阶段寻找依赖配置失败 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (Reason: `ContainerCreating`); `kube_pod_status_phase`: 1 (Phase: Pending) | 验证了 Pod 持续处于等待创建阶段的观测结果，无重启记录 (`restart_count`: 0) |\n\n**证据交叉验证说明：**\nKubernetes 状态（事实 1-3）与 Prometheus 指标（事实 5）高度一致，共同证实 Pod 长期停留在 `ContainerCreating` 等待阶段且无重启。结合诊断逻辑，故障机制锁定在 CNI（Multus）插件因找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源而中断了沙箱构建流程。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 K8s CRD 资源 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' \n→ CNI (Multus) 插件在沙箱创建阶段无法找到网络配置 \n→ Kubelet 创建 Pod Sandbox 失败并产生 FailedCreatePodSandBox 警告 \n→ Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 引用的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源 `unavailable-network` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在（参考事实 4 及诊断上下文）。\n\n**根因作用机制**：Pod 在初始化阶段依赖 Multus CNI 插件进行网络配置。由于缺失该 CRD 资源，插件无法完成网络沙箱（Sandbox）的创建，导致 Kubelet 返回 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误。这直接阻断了容器从 `ContainerCreating` 向 `Running` 状态的转换（参考事实 2、3 及因果链机制）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 45.0s (Evidence 37.0s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.638, "metrics": {"run_id": "212a47b4355d4ee2", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.64509272575378, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 79645.09272575378, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 72059.79585647583, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_